@startuml DCD-02d
title DCD-02d - Diagrama de clases de diseño: capas del backend (4/6) -\nlistas: implementación y repositorios

' Continuación de DCD-02c (ItemListService se detalla allí; SongService, en DCD-02a).
' Fuentes: service/ItemListServiceImpl.java, repository/ItemListRepository.java,
'          ItemRepository.java, utils/EntityResolver.java
' Seis partes: DCD-02a/b canciones (controlador e interfaz / implementación y repositorio),
' DCD-02c/d listas de estudio (ídem), DCD-02e manejo de errores y EntityResolver,
' DCD-02f Utils, constantes y mappers.
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<RestController>> #E3F0FF
    BorderColor<<RestController>> #3D6FA8
    BackgroundColor<<Service>> #E6F5E6
    BorderColor<<Service>> #3C8A3C
    BackgroundColor<<interface>> #F4FBF4
    BorderColor<<interface>> #3C8A3C
    BackgroundColor<<Repository>> #FFF4E0
    BorderColor<<Repository>> #B07A1F
    BackgroundColor<<Component>> #F3F3F3
}
hide empty members

package "service" {
    interface ItemListService <<interface>> <<ver DCD-02c>>
    interface SongService <<interface>> <<ver DCD-02a>>

    class ItemListServiceImpl <<Service>> {
        - itemListRepository : ItemListRepository
        - songService : SongService
        - dtoMapper : DtoMapper
        - entityMapper : EntityMapper
    }
    note bottom of ItemListServiceImpl : addItem (@Transactional):\nfindItemList(listId) + resolveItem(itemId)\n-> ItemList.addItem(item) -> save
}

package "repository" {
    interface "JpaRepository<T, Long>" as JpaRepository <<interface>>
    interface ItemListRepository <<Repository>>
    interface ItemRepository <<Repository>> {
        + findByTitleContainingIgnoreCase(title : String) : List<Item>
    }
}

package "utils" {
    class EntityResolver <<Component>> <<ver DCD-02e>>
    class "mapper.DtoMapper" as DtoMapper <<Component>> <<ver DCD-02f>>
    class "mapper.EntityMapper" as EntityMapper <<Component>> <<ver DCD-02f>>
}

ItemListService <|.. ItemListServiceImpl
ItemListServiceImpl --> SongService
ItemListServiceImpl -down-> ItemListRepository
ItemListServiceImpl ..down.> DtoMapper
ItemListServiceImpl ..down.> EntityMapper
ItemListServiceImpl ..down.> EntityResolver : <<use>>
JpaRepository <|-- ItemListRepository
JpaRepository <|-- ItemRepository
EntityResolver --> ItemListRepository
EntityResolver --> ItemRepository

' Solo para colocar el repositorio debajo de utils (si no, el diagrama es demasiado ancho)
SongService -[hidden]down- DtoMapper
DtoMapper -[hidden]down- JpaRepository
EntityMapper -[hidden]down- JpaRepository

@enduml
